{
  "title": "Dua Aliyat al-Madhamin - Dua to be Recited after the Ziyarat of Every Masoom (a.s.)",
  "data": "Recite after the ziyarat of any of the Imams (a.s.):\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّی زُرْتُ هٰذَا الْاِمَامَ مُقِرًّا بِاِمَامَتِهٖ مُعْتَقِدًا لِفَرْضِ طَاعَتِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ZURTU HAADHAL IMAAMA MUQIRRAN BI-IMAAMATIHEE MU'TAQIDAN LIFARDI TAA'ATIH\nO Allah, I am visiting this Imam confessing his Imamate and believing in the obligation of the obedience to him;\nفَقَصَدْتُ مَشْهَدَهٗ بِذُنُوْبِی وَعُیُوْبِی وَمُوْبِقَاتِ اٰثَامِیْ وَكَثْرَةِ سَیِّئَاتِیْ وَخَطَایَایَ وَمَا تَعْرِفُهٗ مِنِّی\nFAQASADTU MASH-HADAHOO BIDHUNOOBEE WA U'YOOBEE WA MOOBIQAATI AATHAAMEE WA KATHRATI SAYYI'AATEE WA KHATAAYAAYA WA MAA TA'RIFUHOO MINNEE\ntherefore, I have betaken myself to his shrine in spite of all of my sins, defects, the perils of my wrongdoings, my numerous misdeeds and faults, and whatsoever You know about me;\nمُسْتَجِیْرًا بِعَفْوِكَ مُسْتَعِیْذًا بِحِلْمِكَ رَاجِیًا رَحْمَتَكَ لَاجِئًا اِلٰى رُكْنِكَ عَاۤئِذًا بِرَاْفَتِكَ\nMUSTAJEERAN BI-A'FWIKA MUSTA'EEDHAN BIHILMIKA RAAJIYAN RAHMATAKA LAAJI'AN ILAA RUKNIKA A'AA'IDHAN BIRA'FATIK\ntaking shelter in Your amnesty, seeking refuge of Your forbearance, hoping for Your mercy, resorting to Your asylum, seeking the protection of Your compassion,\nمُسْتَشْفِعًا بِوَلِیِّكَ وَابْنِ اَوْلِیَاۤئِكَ وَصَفِیِّكَ وَابْنِ اَصْفِیَاۤئِكَ وَاَمِیْنِكَ وَابْنِ اُمَنَاۤئِكَ وَخَلِیْفَتِكَ وَابْنِ خُلَفَاۤئِكَ\nMUSTASHFI'AN BIWALIYYIKA WABNI AWLIYAA'IKA WA SAFIYYIKA WABNI ASFIYAA'IKA WA AMEENIKA WABNI UMANAA'IKA WA KHALEEFATIKA WABNI KHULAFAA'IK\nseeking the intercession of Your vicegerent and the son of Your vicegerent, Your choicest servant and the son of Your choicest servants, Your trustee and the son of Your trustees, and Your representative and the son of Your representatives,\nالَّذِیْنَ جَعَلْتَهُمُ الْوَسِیْلَةَ اِلٰى رَحْمَتِكَ وَرِضْوَانِكَ وَالذَّرِیْعَةَ اِلٰى رَاْفَتِكَ وَغُفْرَانِكَ\nALLADHEENA JA'ALTAHUMUL WASEELATA ILAA RAHMATIKA WA RIDWAANIKA WADH DHAREE'ATA ILAA RA'FATIKA WA GHUFRAANIK\nwhom You have made the means to approach Your mercy and pleasure and the channels to Your compassion and forgiveness.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَاَوَّلُ حَاجَتِیْۤ اِلَیْكَ اَنْ تَغْفِرَ لِیْ مَا سَلَفَ مِنْ ذُنُوْبِیْ عَلٰى كَثْرَتِهَا\nALLAAHUMMA WA AWWALU HAAJATEE ILAYKA AN TAGHFIRA LEE MAA SALAFA MIN DHUNOOBEE A'LAA KATHRATIHAA\nO Allah, my first need from You is that I implore You to forgive all of my previous sins although they are numerous,\nوَاَنْ تَعْصِمَنِیْ فِیْمَا بَقِیَ مِنْ عُمْرِیْ\nWA AN TA'SIMANEE FEEMAA BAQIYA MIN U'MREE\nto protect me (against sinning) in my coming lifetime,\nوَتُطَهِّرَ دِیْنِیْ مِمَّا یُدَنِّسُهٗ وَیَشِیْنُهٗ وَیُزْرِیْ بِهٖ\nWA TUTAHHIRA DEENEE MIMMAA YUDANNISUHOO WA YASHEENUHOO WA YUZREE BIH\nto purify my religion from whatsoever stains, disgraces, or degrades it,\nوَتَحْمِیَهٗ مِنَ الرَّیْبِ وَالشَّكِّ وَالْفَسَادِ وَالشِّرْكِ\nWA TAHMIYAHOO MINAR RAYBI WASH SHAKKI WAL FASAADI WASH SHIRK\nto save it from suspect, doubt, corruption, and blasphemy,\nوَتُثَبِّتَنِیْ عَلٰى طَاعَتِكَ وَطَاعَةِ رَسُوْلِكَ وَذُرِّیَّتِهِ النُّجَبَاۤءِ السُّعَدَاۤءِ صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَیْهِمْ وَرَحْمَتُكَ وَسَلَامُكَ وَبَرَكَاتُكَ\nWA TUTHABBITANEE A'LAA TAA'ATIKA WA TAA'ATI RASOOLIKA WA DHURRIYYATIHIN NUJABAA'IS SU'ADAA'I SALAWAATUKA A'LAYHIM WA RAHMATUKA WA SALAAMUKA WA BARAKAATUK\nto make me stand firm on the obedience to You, to Your Messenger, and to his Progeny the pure and happy, may Your blessings be upon them as well as Your mercy, peace, and favors,\nوَتُحْیِیَنِیْ مَاۤ اَحْیَیْتَنِیْ عَلٰى طَاعَتِهِمْ وَتُمِیْتَنِیْۤ اِذَاۤ اَمَتَّنِیْ عَلٰى طَاعَتِهِمْ\nWA TUHYIYANEE MAA AHYAYTANEE A'LAA TAA'ATIHIM WA TUMEETANEE IDHAA AMATTANEE A'LAA TAA'ATIHIM\nto make me live as long as You grant me life on the obedience to them, to make me die, when You decide so, on the obedience to them,\nوَاَنْ لَّا تَمْحُوَ مِنْ قَلْبِیْ مَوَدَّتَهُمْ وَمَحَبَّتَهُمْ وَبُغْضَ اَعْدَاۤئِهِمْ وَمُرَافَقَةَ اَوْلِیَاۤئِهِمْ وَبِرَّهُمْ\nWA AL LAA TAMHUWA MIN QALBEE MAWADDATAHUM WA MAHABBATAHUM WA BUGHDA A'DAA'IHIM WA MURAAFAQATA AWLIYAA'IHIM WA BIRRAHUM\nand not to erase from my heart my love and affection for them, my aversion to their enemies, my companionship of their adherents, and my acting piously towards them.\nوَاَسْاَلُكَ یَا رَبِّ اَنْ تَقْبَلَ ذٰلِكَ مِنِّی وَتُحَبِّبَ اِلَیَّ عِبَادَتَكَ وَالْمُوَاظَبَةَ عَلَیْهَا وَتُنَشِّطَنِیْ لَهَا\nWA AS'ALUKA YAA RABBI AN TAQBALA DHAALIKA MINNEE WA TUHABBIBA ILAYYA I'BAADATAKA WAL MUWAAZABATA A'LAYHAA WA TUNASHSHITANEE LAHAA\nI also beseech You, O my Lord, to accept all that from me, to endear my worshipping You to myself, to endue me with perseverance in worship, to make me active in it,\nوَتُبَغِّضَ اِلَیَّ مَعَاصِیَكَ وَمَحَارِمَكَ وَتَدْفَعَنِیْ عَنْهَا\nWA TUBAGHGHIDA ILAYYA MA'AASIYAKA WA MAHAARIMAKA WA TADFA'ANEE A'NHAA\nto make me loathe acts of disobedience to You and acts that You deemed forbidden, to take me away from these acts,\nوَتُجَنِّبَنِیْ التَّقْصِیْرَ فِیْ صَلَوَاتِیْ وَالْاِسْتِهَانَةَ بِهَا وَالتَّرَاخِیَ عَنْهَا\nWA TUJANNIBANIT TAQSEERA FEE SALAWAATEE WAL ISTIHAANATA BIHAA WAT TARAAKHIYA A'NHAA\nto save me against negligence of my prayers, belittling them, and slackening in their performance,\nوَتُوَفِّقَنِیْ لِتَاْدِیَتِهَا كَمَا فَرَضْتَ وَاَمَرْتَ بِهٖ عَلٰى سُنَّةِ رَسُوْلِكَ صَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَیْهِ وَاٰلِهِ وَرَحْمَتُكَ وَبَرَكَاتُكَ خُضُوْعًا وَخُشُوْعًا\nWA TUWAFFIQANEE LITA'DIYATIHAA KAMAA FARADTA WA AMARTA BIHEE A'LAA SUNNATI RASOOLIKA SALAWAATUKA A'LAYHI WA AALIHEE WA RAHMATUKA WA BARAKAATUKA KHUDOO'AN WA KHUSHOO'AA\nto lead me to perform them as perfect as You have made incumbent upon me and as You have commanded according to the traditions of Your Messenger, may Your blessings be upon him and his Household as well as Your mercy and favors, with submission and reverence,\nوَتَشْرَحَ صَدْرِیْ لِاِیْتَاۤءِ الزَّكَاةِ، وَاِعْطَاۤءِ الصَّدَقَاتِ وَبَذْلِ الْمَعْرُوْفِ وَالْاِحْسَانِ اِلٰى شِیْعَةِ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَیْهِمُ السَّلَامُ وَمُوَاسَاتِهِمْ\nWA TASHRAHA SADREE LI-EETAA'IZ ZAKAATI WA I'TAA'IS SADAQAATI WA BADHLIL MA'ROOFI WAL IHSAANI ILAA SHEE'ATI AALI MUHAMMADIN A'LAYHIMUS SALAAMU WA MUWAASAATIHIM\nto expand my breast for defraying the poor-rate, giving alms, giving charity, and doing favors to the adherents of the Household of Muhammad, peace be upon them, and for consoling them.\nوَلَا تَتَوَفَّانِیْۤ اِلَّا بَعْدَ اَنْ تَرْزُقَنِیْ حَجَّ بَیْتِكَ الْحَرَامِ وَزِیَارَةَ قَبْرِ نَبِیِّكَ وَقُبُوْرِ الْاَئِمَّةِ عَلَیْهِمُ السَّلَامُ\nWA LAA TATAWAFFAANEE ILLAA BA'DA AN TARZUQANEE HAJJA BAYTIKAL HARAAMI WA ZIYAARATA QABRI NABIYYIKA WA QUBOORIL A'IMMATI A'LAYHIMUS SALAAM\nDo not take me up (i.e. cause me to die) before You bestow upon me with the favor of going on pilgrimage to Your Sacred House and to the tomb of Your Prophet and the tombs of the Imams, peace be upon them.\nوَاَسْاَلُكَ یَا رَبِّ تَوْبَةً نَصُوْحًا تَرْضَاهَا وَنِیَّةً تَحْمَدُهَا وَعَمَلًا صَالِحًا تَقْبَلُهٗ\nWA AS'ALUKA YAA RABBI TAWBATAN NASOOHAN TARDAAHAA WA NIYYATAN TAHMADUHAA WA A'MALAN SAALIHAN TAQBALUH\nI also beseech You, O Lord, to grant me a sincere repentance that You accept, an intention that You praise, and righteous deed that You admit,\nوَاَنْ تَغْفِرَ لِیْ وَتَرْحَمَنِیْۤ اِذَا تَوَفَّیْتَنِیْ وَتُهَوِّنَ عَلَیَّ سَكَرَاتِ الْمَوْتِ\nWA AN TAGHFIRA LEE WA TARHAMANEE IDHAA TAWAFFAYTANEE WA TUHAWWINA A'LAYYA SAKARAATIL MAWT\nto forgive me and have mercy upon me when You take me up, to make easy for me the agonies of death,\nوَتَحْشُرَنِیْ فِیْ زُمْرَةِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِهِ صَلَوَاتُ اللهِ عَلَیْهِ وَعَلَیْهِمْ وَتُدْخِلَنِیْ الْجَنَّةَ بِرَحْمَتِكَ\nWA TAHSHURANEE FEE ZUMRATI MUHAMMADIN WA AALIHEE SALAWAATULLAAHI A'LAYHI WA A'LAYHIM WA TUDKHILANIL JANNATA BIRAHMATIK\nto include me with the group of Muhammad and his Household, peace of Allah be upon him and them, to allow me to enter Paradise out of Your mercy,\nوَتَجْعَلَ دَمْعِیْ غَزِیْرًا فِیْ طَاعَتِكَ وَعَبْرَتِیْ جَارِیَةً فِیْمَا یُقَرِّبُنِیْ مِنْكَ وَقَلْبِیْ عَطُوْفًا عَلٰۤى اَوْلِیَاۤئِكَ\nWA TAJ'ALA DAM'EE GHAZEERAN FEE TAA'ATIKA WA A'BRATEE JAARIYATAN FEEMAA YUQARRIBUNEE MINKA WA QALBEE A'TOOFAN A'LAA AWLIYAA'IK\nto make me shed heavy tears as obeisance to You, to make my tears always run down in acts that draw me near You, to make my heart sympathetic towards Your intimate servants,\nوَتَصُوْنَنِیْ فِیْ هٰذِهِ الدُّنْیَا مِنَ الْعَاهَاتِ وَالْاٰفَاتِ وَالْاَمْرَاضِ الشَّدِیْدَةِ، وَالْاَسْقَامِ الْمُزْمِنَةِ وَجَمِیْعِ اَنْوَاعِ الْبَلَاۤءِ وَالْحَوَادِثِ\nWA TASOONANEE FEE HAADHIHID DUNYAA MINAL A'AHAATI WAL AAFAATI WAL AMRAADISH SHADEEDATI WAL ASQAAMIL MUZMINATI WA JAMEE'I ANWAA'IL BALAA'I WAL HAWAADITH\nto save me in this worldly life from handicaps, epidemics, incurable diseases, chronic illnesses, and all sorts of misfortunes and catastrophes.\nوَتَصْرِفَ قَلْبِیْ عَنِ الْحَرَامِ وَتُبَغِّضَ اِلَیَّ مَعَاصِیَكَ وَتُحَبِّبَ اِلَیَّ الْحَلَالَ وَتَفْتَحَ لِیْۤ اَبْوَابَهٗ\nWA TASRIFA QALBEE A'NIL HARAAMI WA TUBAGHGHIDA ILAYYA MA'AASIYAKA WA TUHABBIBA ILAYYAL HALAALA WA TAFTAHA LEE ABWAABAH\n[I also beseech You to] cause my heart to turn away from the forbidden (acts and things), make me hate acts of disobedience to You, make me love the legally gotten sustenance open its doors before me,\nوَتُثَبِّتَ نِیَّتِیْ وَفِعْلِی عَلَیْهِ وَتَمُدَّ فِیْ عُمْرِیْ وَتُغْلِقَ اَبْوَابَ الْمِحَنِ عَنِّیْ\nWA TUTHABBITA NIYYATEE WA FI'LEE A'LAYHI WA TAMUDDA FEE U'MREE WA TUGHLIQA ABWAABAL MIHANI A'NNEE\nmake firm my intention and my deeds on it, extend my lifetime, and close the doors of adversaries before me\nوَلَا تَسْلُبَنِیْ مَا مَنَنْتَ بِهٖ عَلَیَّ وَلَا تَسْتَرِدَّ شَیْئًا مِمَّاۤ اَحْسَنْتَ بِهٖ اِلَیَّ وَلَا تَنْزِعَ مِنِّیْ النِّعَمَ الَّتِیْۤ اَنْعَمْتَ بِهَا عَلَیَّ\nWA LAA TASLUBANEE MAA MANANTA BIHEE A'LAYYA WA LAA TASTARIDDA SHAY'AN MIMMAA AHSANTA BIHEE ILAYYA WA LAA TANZI'A MINNIN NI'AMAL LATEE AN'AMTA BIHAA A'LAYY\n(Please) do not deprive me of whatsoever You have favored upon me, do not take back from me the graces that You have granted me, do not strip me of the elegances that You have conferred upon me;\nوَتَزِیْدَ فِیْمَا خَوَّلْتَنِیْ وَتُضَاعِفَهٗ اَضْعَافًا مُضَاعَفَةً\nWA TAZEEDA FEEMAA KHAWWALTANEE WA TUDAA'IFAHOO AD'AAFAN MUDAA'AFAH\n[rather, please] increase that which You have authorized me to possess, expand it many folds for me,\nوَتَرْزُقَنِیْ مَالًا كَثِیْرًا وَاسِعًا سَاۤئِغًا هَنِیْۤئًا نَامِیًا وَافِیًا وَعِزًّا بَاقِیًا كَافِیًا وَجَاهًا عَرِیْضًا مَنِیْعًا وَنِعْمَةً سَابِغَةً عَآمَّةً\nWA TARZUQANEE MAALAN KATHEERAN WAASI'AN SAA'IGHAN HANEE'AN NAAMIYAN WAAFIYAN WA I'ZZAN BAAQIYAN KAAFIYAN WA JAAHAN A'REEDAN MANEE'AN WA NI'MATAN SAABIGHATAN A'AAMMAH\nand provide me with fortune that is very much, spacious, agreeable, joyful, growing, and satisfactory, and with dignity that is everlasting and sufficient, and with prestige that is outgoing and overwhelming, and with bounty that is flowing and broad.\nوَتُغْنِیَنِیْ بِذٰلِكَ عَنِ الْمَطَالِبِ الْمُنَكَّدَةِ وَالْمَوَارِدِ الصَّعْبَةِ\nWA TUGHNIYANEE BIDHAALIKA A'NIL MATAALIBIL MUNAKKADATI WAL MAWAARIDIS SA'BAH\nThrough all that, (please) make me dispense with the humiliating appeals and unreachable sources,\nوَتُخَلِّصَنِیْ مِنْهَا مُعَافًى فِیْ دِیْنِیْ وَنَفْسِیْ وَوَلَدِیْ وَمَاۤ اَعْطَیْتَنِیْ، وَمَنَحْتَنِیْ\nWA TUKHALLISANEE MINHAA MU'AAFAN FEE DEENEE WA NAFSEE WA WALADEE WA MAA A'TAYTANEE WA MANAHTANEE\nsave me from them with good health as regards my religion, self, sons, and whatsoever You have given and granted me,\nوَتَحْفَظَ عَلَیَّ مَالِیْ وَجَمِیْعَ مَا خَوَّلْتَنِیْ وَتَقْبِضَ عَنِّیْۤ اَیْدِی الْجَبَابِرَةِ وَتَرُدَّنِیْۤ اِلٰى وَطَنِیْ\nWA TAHFAZA A'LAYYA MAALEE WA JAMEE'A MAA KHAWWALTANEE WA TAQBIDA A'NNEE AYDIL JABAABIRATI WA TARUDDANEE ILAA WATANEE\npreserve for me my properties and whatsoever You have put under my disposal, watch me against the hands of the tyrants, take me back to my homeland (safely),\nوَتُبَلِّغَنِیْ نِهَایَةَ اَمَلِیْ فِی دُنْیَایَ وَاٰخِرَتِیْ وَتَجْعَلَ عَاقِبَةَ اَمْرِیْ مَحْمُوْدَةً حَسَنَةً سَلِیْمَةً\nWA TUBALLIGHANEE NIHAAYATA AMALEE FEE DUNYAAYA WA AAKHIRATEE WA TAJ'ALA A'AQIBATA AMREE MAHMOODATAN HASANATAN SALEEMAH\nconfer upon me the utmost of my hope in my worldly life and the Hereafter, make the consequence of my conducts praiseworthy, good, and sound,\nوَتَجْعَلَنِیْ رَحِیْبَ الصَّدْرِ وَاسِعَ الْحَالِ حَسَنَ الْخُلْقِ بَعِیْدًا مِنَ الْبُخْلِ وَالْمَنْعِ وَالنِّفَاقِ وَالْكِذْبِ وَالْبَهْتِ وَقَوْلِ الزُّوْرِ\nWA TAJ'ALANEE RAHEEBAS SADRI WAASI'AL HAALI HASANAL KHULQI BA'EEDAN MINAL BUKHLI WAL MAN'I WAN NIFAAQI WAL KIDHBI WAL BAHTI WA QAWLIZ ZOOR\nmake me broadminded, well-off, and well-mannered, [and take me] away from miserliness, stinginess, hypocrisy, fabrication, slander, and perjury.\nوَتُرْسِخَ فِی قَلْبِیْ مَحَبَّةَ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَشِیْعَتِهِمْ\nWA TURSIKHA FEE QALBEE MAHABBATA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN WA SHEE'ATIHIM\n[Please] make firm in my heart the love for Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad and their adherents (Shi'ah).\nوَتَحْرُسَنِیْ یَا رَبِّ فِیْ نَفْسِیْ وَاَهْلِیْ وَمَالِیْ وَوَلَدِیْ وَاَهْلِ حُزَانَتِیْ وَاِخْوَانِیْ وَاَهْلِ مَوَدَّتِیْ وَذُرِّیَّتِیْ بِرَحْمَتِكَ وَجُوْدِكَ\nWA TAHRUSANEE YAA RABBI FEE NAFSEE WA AHLEE WA MAALEE WA WALADEE WA AHLI HUZAANATEE WA IKHWAANEE WA AHLI MAWADDATEE WA DHURRIYYATEE BIRAHMATIKA WA JOODIK\nO Lord, guard me, my family, my properties, my sons, those who are under my custody, my brothers, those whom I love, and my offspring in the name of Your mercy and Magnanimity.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ هٰذِهِ حَاجَاتِیْ عِنْدَكَ وَقَدِ اسْتَكْثَرْتُهَا لِلُؤْمِیْ وَشُحِّیْ وَهِیَ عِنْدَكَ صَغِیْرَةٌ حَقِیْرَةٌ وَعَلَیْكَ سَهْلَةٌ یَسِیْرَةٌ\nALLAAHUMMA HAADHIHEE HAAJAATEE I'NDAKA WA QADIS TAKTHARTUHAA LILU'MEE WA SHUHHEE WA HIYA I'NDAKA SAGHEERATUN HAQEERATUN WA A'LAYKA SAHLATUN YASEERAH\nO Allah, these are my needs from You. Out of my meanness and avarice, I have considered these needs great, while in Your view they are insignificantly small and they are easy and effortless for You.\nفَاَسْاَلُكَ بِجَاهِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَیْهِ وَعَلَیْهِمُ السَّلَامُ عِنْدَكَ وَبِحَقِّهِمْ عَلَیْكَ وَبِمَاۤ اَوْجَبْتَ لَهُمْ\nFA-AS'ALUKA BIJAAHI MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN A'LAYHI WA A'LAYHIMUS SALAAMU I'NDAKA WA BIHAQQIHIM A'LAYKA WA BIMAA AWJABTA LAHUM\nI thus beseech You in the name of the standing of Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad, peace be upon him and them, in Your view, in the name of Your duty towards You, in the name of what You have made incumbent upon Yourself towards them,\nوَبِسَاۤئِرِ اَنْبِیَاۤئِكَ وَرُسُلِكَ وَاَصْفِیَاۤئِكَ وَاَوْلِیَاۤئِكَ الْمُخْلَصِیْنَ مِنْ عِبَادِكَ وَبِاسْمِكَ الْاَعْظَمِ الْاَعْظَمِ\nWA BISAA'IRI ANBIYAA'IKA WA RUSULIKA WA ASFIYAA'IKA WA AWLIYAA'IKAL MUKHLASEENA MIN I'BAADIKA WA BISMIKAL A'ZAMIL A'ZAM\nin the name of Your other Prophets and Messengers, in the name of Your choicest ones and intimate servants whom You have selected over others for worshipping You, and in the name of Your Grand, Substantial Name,\nلَمَّا قَضَیْتَهَا كُلَّهَا وَاَسْعَفْتَنِیْ بِهَا وَلَمْ تُخَیِّبْ اَمَلِیْ وَرَجَاۤئِیْ\nLAMMAA QADAYTAHAA KULLAHAA WA AS'AFTANEE BIHAA WA LAM TUKHAYYIB AMALEE WA RAJAA'EE\n(I beseech You by all these) to grant me all of my requests, to relieve me through settling them for me, and not to disappoint nor let me down.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَشَفِّعْ صَاحِبَ هٰذَا الْقَبْرِ فِیَّ\nALLAAHUMMA WA SHAFFI' SAAHIBA HAADHAL QABRI FIYY\nO Allah, (please) accept the one in this tomb as my interceder before You.\nیَا سَیِّدِیْ یَا وَلِیَّ اللهِ یَاۤ اَمِیْنَ اللهِ\nYAA SAYYIDEE YAA WALIYYALLAAHI YAA AMEENALLAAH\nO my Master! O Allah’s vicegerent! O Allah’s trustee!\nاَسْاَلُكَ اَنْ تَشْفَعَ لِیْۤ اِلَى اللهِ عَزَّ وَجَلَّ فِیْ هٰذِهِ الْحَاجَاتِ كُلِّهَا\nAS'ALUKA AN TASHFA'A LEE ILALLAAHI A'ZZA WAJALLA FEE HAADHIHIL HAAJAATI KULLIHAA\nI beseech you to intercede for me before Allah the Almighty and All-majestic so that He may approve of and grant me all of my requests\nبِحَقِّ اٰبَاۤئِكَ الطَّاهِرِیْنَ وَبِحَقِّ اَوْلَادِكَ الْمُنْتَجَبِیْنَ\nBIHAQQI AABAA'IKAT TAAHIREENA WA BIHAQQI AWLAADIKAL MUNTAJABEEN\nin the name of Your Immaculate fathers and in the name of Your well-selected sons.\nفَاِنَّ لَكَ عِنْدَ اللهِ تَقَدَّسَتْ اَسْمَاۤؤُهُ الْمَنْزِلَةَ الشَّرِیْفَةَ وَالْمَرْتَبَةَ الْجَلِیْلَةَ وَالْجَاهَ الْعَرِیْضَ\nFA-INNA LAKA I'NDALLAAHI TAQADDASAT ASMAA'UHUL MANZILATASH SHAREEFATA WAL MARTABATAL JALEELATA WAL JAAHAL A'REED\nVerily, you enjoy in the view of Allah, sacred be His Names, an honorable standing, a lofty rank, and a spacious regard.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَوْ عَرَفْتُ مَنْ هُوَ اَوْجَهُ عِنْدَكَ مِنْ هٰذَا الْاِمَامِ وَمِنْ اٰبَاۤئِهٖ وَاَبْنَاۤئِهِ الطَّاهِرِیْنَ عَلَیْهِمُ السَّلَامُ وَالصَّلَاةُ\nALLAAHUMMA LAW A'RAFTU MAN HUWA AWJAHU I'NDAKA MIN HAADHAL IMAAMI WA MIN AABAA'IHEE WA ABNAA'IHIT TAAHIREENA A'LAYHIMUS SALAAMU WAS SALAAH\nO Allah, had I known a person more acceptable in Your view than this Imam and his immaculate fathers and sons, peace and blessings be upon them,\nلَجَعَلْتُهُمْ شُفَعَاۤئِیْ وَقَدَّمْتُهُمْ اَمَامَ حَاجَتِیْ وَطَلِبَاتِیْ هٰذِهِ\nLAJA'ALTUHUM SHUFA'AA'EE WA QADDAMTUHUM AMAAMA HAAJATEE WA TALIBAATEE HAADHIH\nI would have chosen them to be my interceders (before You) and I would have introduced them as means by whom I would put before You my needs and requests.\nفَاسْمَعْ مِنِّیْ وَاسْتَجِبْ لِیْ وَافْعَلْ بِیْ مَاۤ اَنْتَ اَهْلُهٗ یَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ\nFASMA' MINNEE WASTAJIB LEE WAF'AL BEE MAA ANTA AHLUHOO YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nTherefore, (please) hear from me, respond to me, and do to me that which You alone are worthy to do. O most merciful of all those who show mercy.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَمَا قَصُرَتْ عَنْهُ مَسْاَلَتِیْ وَعَجَزَتْ عَنْهُ قُوَّتِیْ وَلَمْ تَبْلُغْهُ فِطْنَتِیْ مِنْ صَالِحِ دِیْنِیْ وَدُنْیَایَ وَاٰخِرَتِیْ\nALLAAHUMMA WA MAA QASURAT A'NHU MAS'ALATEE WA A'JAZAT A'NHU QUWWATEE WA LAM TABLUGH-HU FITNATEE MIN SAALIHI DEENEE WA DUNYAAYA WA AAKHIRATEE\nO Allah, as regards the needs that my requests have not included, the things that I am too powerless to do, and the things that I am not too clever to mention, among the things that prosper my religion, worldly life, and next life;\nفَامْنُنْ بِهٖ عَلَیَّ وَاحْفَظْنِیْ وَاحْرُسْنِیْ وَهَبْ لِیْ وَاغْفِرْ لِیْ\nFAMNUN BIHEE A'LAYYA WAHFAZNEE WAHRUSNEE WA HAB LEE WAGHFIR LEE\n(please) confer upon me with these, protect me, guard me, bestow upon me (with Your favors), and forgive me.\nوَمَنْ اَرَادَنِیْ بِسُوْۤءٍ اَوْ مَكْرُوْهٍ مِنْ شَیْطَانٍ مَرِیْدٍ اَوْ سُلْطَانٍ عَنِیْدٍ اَوْ مُخَالِفٍ فِیْ دِیْنٍ اَوْ مُنَازِعٍ فِیْ دُنْیَا اَوْ حَاسِدٍ عَلَیَّ نِعْمَةً اَوْ ظَالِمٍ اَوْ بَاغٍ\nWA MAN ARAADANEE BISOO'IN AW MAKROOHIN MIN SHAYTAANIN MAREEDIN AW SULTAANIN A'NEEDIN AW MUKHAALIFIN FEE DEENIN AW MUNAAZI'IN FEE DUNYAA AW HAASIDIN A'LAYYA NI'MATAN AW ZAALIMIN AW BAAGH\nAs for any one who intends evil or wickedness to me, such as a rebellious devil, a tyrant ruler, a dissident miscreant, a rival in a worldly affair, one who envies me for a grace, an unjust individual, or a despot;\nفَاقْبِضْ عَنِّیْ یَدَهٗ وَاصْرِفْ عَنِّیْ كَیْدَهٗ وَاشْغَلْهُ عَنِّی بِنَفْسِهٖ وَاكْفِنِیْ شَرَّهٗ وَشَرَّ اَتْبَاعِهٖ وَشَیَاطِیْنِهٖ\nFAQBID A'NNEE YADAHOO WASRIF A'NNEE KAYDAHOO WASHGHALHU A'NNEE BINAFSIHEE WAKFINEE SHARRAHOO WA SHARRA ATBAA'IHEE WA SHAYAATEENIH\nthen (please) make their hands too short to catch me, take away their plots against me, preoccupy them against me with their own affairs, save me from their evils and the evils of their followers and devils,\nوَاَجِرْنِیْ مِنْ كُلِّ مَا یَضُرُّنِیْ وَیُجْحِفُ بِیْ وَاَعْطِنِیْ جَمِیْعَ الْخَیْرِ كُلِّهٖ مِمَّاۤ اَعْلَمُ وَمِمَّا لَاۤ اَعْلَمُ\nWA AJIRNEE MIN KULLI MAA YADURRUNEE WA YUJHIFU BEE WA A'TINEE JAMEE'AL KHAYRI KULLIHEE MIMMAA A'LAMU WA MIMMAA LAA A'LAM\nstand by me against whatsoever may harm and do injustice to me, and (please) grant me the entire goodness whether I know or I do not.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاغْفِرْ لِیْ وَلِوَالِدَیَّ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN WAGHFIR LEE WA LIWAALIDAYY\nO Allah, bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad and forgive me, my parents,\nوَلِاِخْوَانِیْ وَاَخَوَاتِیْ وَاَعْمَامِیْ وَعَمَّاتِیْ وَاَخْوَالِیْ وَخَالَاتِیْ وَاَجْدَادِیْ وَجَدَّاتِیْ وَاَوْلَادِهِمْ، وَذَرَارِیْهِمْ\nWA LI-IKHWAANEE WA AKHAWAATEE WA A'MAAMEE WA A'MMAATEE WA AKHWAALEE WA KHAALAATEE WA AJDAADEE WA JADDAATEE WA AWLAADIHIM WA DHARAAREEHIM\nmy brothers, my sisters, my (paternal) uncles, my (paternal) aunts, my (maternal) uncles, my (maternal) aunts, my forefathers, my foremothers, their descendants, their offspring,\nوَاَزْوَاجِیْ وَذُرِّیَاتِیْ وَاَقْرَبَاۤئِیْ وَاَصْدِقَاۤئِیْ وَجِیْرَانِیْ وَاِخْوَانِیْ فِیْكَ مِنْ اَهْلِ الشَّرْقِ وَالْغَرْبِ\nWA AZWAAJEE WA DHURRIYAATEE WA AQRABAA'EE WA ASDIQAA'EE WA JEERAANEE WA IKHWAANEE FEEKA MIN AHLISH SHARQI WAL GHARB\nmy spouse(s), my offspring, my relatives, my friends, my neighbors, my brothers-in-faith from the people of the east and the west (of the earth),\nوَلِجَمِیْعِ اَهْلِ مَوَدَّتِیْ مِنَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ الْاَحْیَاۤءِ مِنْهُمْ وَالْاَمْوَاتِ\nWA LIJAMEE'I AHLI MAWADDATEE MINAL MU'MINEENA WAL MU'MINAATIL AHYAA'I MINHUM WAL AMWAAT\nall those whom I love among the believing men and women, be they alive or dead,\nوَلِجَمِیْعِ مَنْ عَلَّمَنِیْ خَیْرًا اَوْ تَعَلَّمَ مِنِّیْ عِلْمًا\nWA LIJAMEE'I MAN A'LLAMANEE KHAYRAN AW TA'ALLAMA MINNEE I'LMAA\nall those who have ever taught me an item of decency, and those who have received from me an item of knowledge.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَشْرِكْهُمْ فِیْ صَالِحِ دُعَاۤئِیْ وَزِیَارَتِیْ لِمَشْهَدِ حُجَّتِكَ وَوَلِیِّكَ\nALLAAHUMMA ASHRIK-HUM FEE SAALIHI DU'AA'EE WA ZIYAARATEE LIMASH-HADI HUJJATIKA WA WALIYYIK\nO Allah, make all these have a share in my best supplications to You and in my (ritual) pilgrimages to the shrine of Your Argument and Your vicegerent;\nوَاَشْرِكْنِیْ فِیْ صَالِحِ اَدْعِیَتِهِمْ بِرَحْمَتِكَ یَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ\nWA ASHRIKNEE FEE SAALIHI AD'IYATIHIM BIRAHMATIKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nmake me have a share in the best of their supplications, in the name of Your mercy, O most merciful of all those who show mercy.\nوَبَلِّغْ وَلِیَّكَ مِنْهُمُ السَّلَامَ\nWA BALLIGH WALIYYAKA MINHUMUS SALAAM\nConvey their greetings to Your vicegerent.\nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ وَرَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWAS SALAAMU A'LAYKA WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace and Allah's mercy and blessings be upon you.\nیَا سَیِّدِیْ یَا مَوْلَایَ یَا فُلَانَ بْنَ فُلَانٍ\nYAA SAYYIDEE YAA MAWLAAYA YAA FULAANABNA FULAAN\nO my master, O my leader; O...\nHere, mention the name of the Imam you are visiting.\nصَلَّى اللهُ عَلَیْكَ وَعَلٰى رُوْحِكَ وَبَدَنِكَ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAYKA WA A'LAA ROOHIKA WA BADANIK\nmay Allah bless you, your soul, and your body;\nاَنْتَ وَسِیْلَتِیْۤ اِلَى اللهِ وَذَرِیْعَتِیْۤ اِلَیْهِ\nANTA WASEELATEE ILALLAAHI WA DHAREE'ATEE ILAYH\nyou are my means to approach Allah and my way towards Him;\nوَلِیْ حَقُّ مُوَالَاتِیْ وَتَاْمِیْلِیْ\nWA LEE HAQQU MUWAALAATEE WA TA'MEELEE\nand I enjoy the right of my loyalty to you and the right of my putting my entire hope in you;\nفَكُنْ شَفِیْعِیْۤ اِلَى اللهِ عَزَّ وَجَلَّ فِی الْوُقُوْفِ عَلٰى قِصَّتِیْ هٰذِهِ\nFAKUN SHAFEE'EE ILALLAAHI A'ZZA WAJALLA FIL WUQOOFI A'LAA QISSATEE HAADHIH\ntherefore, be my interceder before Allah the Almighty and All-majestic so that He shall regard my story (that I have just told)\nوَصَرْفِیْ عَنْ مَوْقِفِیْ هٰذَا بِالنُّجْحِ بِمَا سَاَلْتُهٗ كُلِّهٖ بِرَحْمَتِهٖ وَقُدْرَتِهٖ\nWA SARFEE A'N MAWQIFEE HAADHAA BIN NUJHI BIMAA SA'ALTUHOO KULLIHEE BIRAHMATIHEE WA QUDRATIH\nand so that He shall decide success to be the result of all of my requests in this situation of mine that I have besought from Him, out of His mercy and omnipotence.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ ارْزُقْنِیْ عَقْلًا كَامِلًا وَلُبًّا رَاجِحًا وَعِزًّا بَاقِیًا وَقَلْبًا زَكِیًّا وَعَمَلًا كَثِیْرًا وَاَدَبًا بَارِعًا\nALLAAHUMMAR ZUQNEE A'QLAN KAAMILAN WA LUBBAN RAAJIHAN WA I'ZZAN BAAQIYAN WA QALBAN ZAKIYYAN WA A'MALAN KATHEERAN WA ADABAN BAARI'AA\nO Allah, (please) bestow upon me a perfect intellectuality, a sagacious reason, an everlasting might, a pure heart, a very much deed, and excellent manners;\nوَاجْعَلْ ذٰلِكَ كُلَّهٗ لِیْ وَلَا تَجْعَلْهُ عَلَیَّ بِرَحْمَتِكَ یَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ\nWAJ'AL DHAALIKA KULLAHOO LEE WA LAA TAJ'ALHU A'LAYYA BIRAHMATIKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\ndecide all these to be for my good, but do not make them stand against me; in the name of Your mercy, O most merciful of all those who show mercy.",
  "merits": "Sayyid Ibn Tawus, in his book of Misbah al-Za'ir, has mentioned this supplicatory prayer to be said directly after the comprehensive form of ziyarah that is known as Ziyarah of the Imams of the Believers."
}
